 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Nice of them to visit. Do they have a guests room that needs changed, or fresh one? water is always welcome. A little box of snacks that isn't too flashy helps too. A clean changes of sheets and a fresh towel or two never hurts. A note saying the room is now yours politely asking them to take it down after they've gone is the easiest way. If you change the password, tell them the new one too. A simple vase of fresh flowers is lovely. If you want go the extra mile, there are guest bathrooms nearby that could use a fresh pack of tissues or new roll of paper towels.",
